⚙️ Chapter 3: System Requirements Specification (SRS)

• 3.1 Functional Requirements:
	• The system must access the integrated camera hardware instantly upon launch.
	• It must draw tracking rectangles around identified items with high confidence (> 40%).
	• It must deliver clear audio instructions (e.g., "chair on your left").
• 3.2 Non-Functional Requirements:
	• Latency: The processing delay from capturing a frame to updating the user must remain below 100 milliseconds.
	• Portability: The application code must run on standard Python environments without requiring commercial, closed-source dependencies.
• 3.3 Hardware Requirements: Integrated Webcam, Core i3/i5 Processor, 4GB RAM.
• 3.4 Software Requirements: Windows 10/11 or Linux OS, Python 3.10+, OpenCV library, NumPy, Pyttsx3.
