[Audio Output Engine] ⬅️ [Directional Matrix Processor] ⬅️ [NMS Box Filter]
• 4.2 Algorithmic Logic (Spatial Segmentation):
The frame canvas width (W) is dynamically split into three equal vertical segments:
	• If object center coordinate \(X < \frac{W}{3}\) → Target is on the Left
	• If object center coordinate \(X > \frac{2W}{3}\) → Target is on the Right
	• Otherwise → Target is Straight Ahead

